{"4429970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echo of God", "steam_appid": 4429970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend Into a world broken by Gods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/896c850e66988e3e6f6f9b624b99d26f.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, the world lived in perfect harmony, until the world succumbed to the destructive powers of Chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Bloodlines fall. Monsters appear where there was once peace, along with a young kid armed with a mysterious tool known only as the Echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Echo of a Metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/69ca3e5ab37f9372e87957ee937d30fd.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path through a world that reacts to divine imbalance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet strange allies, and decide how much power you’re willing to sacrifice to change fate itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Bloodline is bound to an Echo, a soul-bound crest that grants godly power under specific conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit Gods have unlimited power. Non-Spirit Gods must pay the price to use their power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Echo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/97bb71a09ec91040c6d31cc1a94f816c.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Echo is a family Bloodline crest in order for gods to trigger their powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Bloodline has an Echo that isn’t attached to the body but a physical jewel/crest that is bound to a person, sometimes in a necklace, an amulet,  in a sword, bracelet, anything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the entire Bloodline of gods dies, the echos are freed and the power goes to the Bloodline who removed the lineage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are Five Bloodlines. Time, Power, Chaos, Knowledge, and Power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Echo has different criteria that needs to be met in order for the family to use each God’s power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human Gods are unable to use powers excessively because there is a downside to using a power each time. Unless you possess each Echo, only the Spirit gods can use the powers as much as they want with no downsides.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/637c1fb1218707b9f42c97b923c1c539.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic late-90s Metroidvania  / Action Platformer adventure with JRPG elements and a silly soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layered with party mechanics, dual ability skills, collectibles, and character upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss battles with an emphasis on skill and precise movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story is told through animation, atmosphere, and environmental detail, allowing players to uncover meaning at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art inspired by the PlayStation era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful locations, parallax backgrounds, and ambient soundscapes give depth and bring the world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander overgrown forests, sacred shrines, and caverns with each region altered by the misalignment of the Gods who once protected it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are divine inheritances. Each new ability alters traversal, combat, and your understanding of the Gods who shaped the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient items that must be appraised before revealing their true effects. Equip chains to customize stats, abilities, and playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/7895e19a4345653d80f4fef4a15834a1.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/0f7dc1dcc1fcf8ed288bbc42f9716799.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/fe70aa0e80f14b4b1507d2ad2d17203a.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/333b10ca08ad34fdf55bbab3a1902fe3.poster.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/333b10ca08ad34fdf55bbab3a1902fe3.webm?t=1786156808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/333b10ca08ad34fdf55bbab3a1902fe3.mp4?t=1786156808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/c532dd9f71db48983184ac7388984f2e.poster.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/c532dd9f71db48983184ac7388984f2e.webm?t=1786156808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/c532dd9f71db48983184ac7388984f2e.mp4?t=1786156808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/fed84ffa360cb801a4b1fcbe17746861.poster.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/fed84ffa360cb801a4b1fcbe17746861.webm?t=1786156808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/fed84ffa360cb801a4b1fcbe17746861.mp4?t=1786156808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend Into a world broken by Gods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/896c850e66988e3e6f6f9b624b99d26f.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, the world lived in perfect harmony, until the world succumbed to the destructive powers of Chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Bloodlines fall. Monsters appear where there was once peace, along with a young kid armed with a mysterious tool known only as the Echo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Echo of a Metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/69ca3e5ab37f9372e87957ee937d30fd.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path through a world that reacts to divine imbalance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet strange allies, and decide how much power you’re willing to sacrifice to change fate itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Bloodline is bound to an Echo, a soul-bound crest that grants godly power under specific conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit Gods have unlimited power. Non-Spirit Gods must pay the price to use their power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Echo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/97bb71a09ec91040c6d31cc1a94f816c.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Echo is a family Bloodline crest in order for gods to trigger their powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Bloodline has an Echo that isn’t attached to the body but a physical jewel/crest that is bound to a person, sometimes in a necklace, an amulet,  in a sword, bracelet, anything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the entire Bloodline of gods dies, the echos are freed and the power goes to the Bloodline who removed the lineage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are Five Bloodlines. Time, Power, Chaos, Knowledge, and Power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Echo has different criteria that needs to be met in order for the family to use each God’s power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human Gods are unable to use powers excessively because there is a downside to using a power each time. Unless you possess each Echo, only the Spirit gods can use the powers as much as they want with no downsides.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429970/extras/637c1fb1218707b9f42c97b923c1c539.avif?t=1786156808\" width=776 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic late-90s Metroidvania  / Action Platformer adventure with JRPG elements and a silly soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layered with party mechanics, dual ability skills, collectibles, and character upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss battles with an emphasis on skill and precise movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story is told through animation, atmosphere, and environmental detail, allowing players to uncover meaning at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art inspired by the PlayStation era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful locations, parallax backgrounds, and ambient soundscapes give depth and bring the world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander overgrown forests, sacred shrines, and caverns with each region altered by the misalignment of the Gods who once protected it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are divine inheritances. Each new ability alters traversal, combat, and your understanding of the Gods who shaped the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient items that must be appraised before revealing their true effects. Equip chains to customize stats, abilities, and playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset